{"v":1,"id":"6568e9b22fb5","synced":true,"offset":0,"source":"suno","lines":[{"t":"Verse 1 — soft, warm, gently rising)","s":14.34,"e":16.44},{"t":"You speak in the hush of morning,","s":16.46,"e":21.24},{"t":"A whisper drifting through the light…","s":21.36,"e":27.59},{"t":"“I am making all things new,” You say,","s":24.41,"e":32.36},{"t":"And the shadows begin to melt from sight.","s":32.42,"e":39.25},{"t":"The mountains bow in reverence,","s":39.3,"e":42.49},{"t":"The oceans breathe Your name…","s":42.55,"e":44.68},{"t":"For the Kingdom comes in quiet steps,","s":44.7,"e":49.05},{"t":"And nothing will remain the same.","s":49.13,"e":55.17},{"t":"Every tear You gather,","s":55.22,"e":58.44},{"t":"Every heart You mend…","s":58.49,"e":61.12},{"t":"You lift the broken from the dust","s":61.22,"e":64.21},{"t":"And make them whole again.","s":64.32,"e":73.39},{"t":"Behold, the Kingdom coming,","s":73.47,"e":77.65},{"t":"A dawn without an end…","s":77.77,"e":80.71},{"t":"Where sorrow cannot follow,","s":80.78,"e":84.02},{"t":"And peace is born again.","s":84.12,"e":86.44},{"t":"Your light falls on the nations,","s":86.51,"e":90.48},{"t":"And every fear is gone…","s":90.58,"e":93.71},{"t":"The New Earth rises in Your love,","s":93.77,"e":97.84},{"t":"O Lord, forever strong.","s":97.96,"e":102.79},{"t":"⸻","s":99.81,"e":102.79},{"t":"(Verse 2 — soft, intimate, comforting)","s":99.81,"e":112.48},{"t":"You walk beside the humble,","s":112.56,"e":115.67},{"t":"You call the weary home…","s":115.75,"e":118.71},{"t":"You plant the gardens of the new world","s":118.78,"e":122.14},{"t":"Where living waters flow.","s":122.22,"e":125.53},{"t":"And all creation listens,","s":125.6,"e":128.74},{"t":"The trees lift up their hands…","s":128.8,"e":131.63},{"t":"For the Son of Glory speaks again,","s":131.71,"e":134.82},{"t":"And healing covers every land.","s":134.9,"e":139.61},{"t":"You are the God who dwells with men,","s":139.69,"e":143.2},{"t":"Closer than our breath…","s":143.28,"e":146.01},{"t":"You silence every memory","s":146.11,"e":149.1},{"t":"Of pain and loss and death.","s":149.22,"e":152.97},{"t":"In the brightness of Your presence,","s":153.03,"e":156.58},{"t":"The old has passed away…","s":156.64,"e":159.0},{"t":"We rise to see the New Earth bloom,","s":159.08,"e":162.71},{"t":"Bathed in endless day.","s":162.75,"e":168.09},{"t":"Behold, the Kingdom coming,","s":168.17,"e":172.28},{"t":"A dawn without an end…","s":172.4,"e":175.37},{"t":"Where every child is sheltered","s":175.46,"e":178.55},{"t":"And every wound can mend.","s":178.65,"e":181.15},{"t":"Your light becomes our dwelling,","s":181.22,"e":185.07},{"t":"Your voice our perfect peace…","s":185.14,"e":188.36},{"t":"The New Earth sings beneath Your feet,","s":188.44,"e":191.83},{"t":"Where all our striving ceases.","s":191.87,"e":199.96},{"t":"Oh Lord, You make all things new…","s":200.06,"e":207.21},{"t":"And we belong to You.","s":207.31,"e":210.47},{"t":"Forever.","s":210.56,"e":217.01},{"t":"Forever.","s":217.1,"e":219.52},{"t":"Amen.","s":219.64,"e":223.55},{"t":"Behold, the Kingdom coming,","s":223.63,"e":227.81},{"t":"A dawn without an end…","s":227.93,"e":230.9},{"t":"Where every child is sheltered","s":230.99,"e":234.08},{"t":"And every wound can mend.","s":234.18,"e":236.68},{"t":"Your light becomes our dwelling,","s":236.75,"e":240.6},{"t":"Your voice our perfect peace…","s":240.67,"e":243.87},{"t":"The New Earth sings beneath Your feet,","s":243.93,"e":248.82},{"t":"Where all our striving ceases.","s":248.89,"e":255.21},{"t":"⸻","s":251.23,"e":255.21},{"t":"(Outro — soft, reverent)","s":251.23,"e":264.42},{"t":"Oh Lord, You make all things new…","s":264.53,"e":270.6},{"t":"And we belong to You.","s":270.66,"e":275.58},{"t":"Forever.","s":275.67,"e":278.61},{"t":"Forever.","s":278.7,"e":282.28},{"t":"Amen.","s":282.37,"e":282.91}],"match":null}
